   114|/**
   115| * Stale job expiration timeout (ms). A RUNNING job whose `startedAt` is older
   116| * than this is automatically expired (marked FAILED) so a new job can start.
   117| * Configurable via `IVX_WORKER_STALE_TIMEOUT_MS` env var.
