     8|/**
     9| * OPEN-ON-LATEST BOUNDED LOAD (2026-07-19): the owner reported the IVX chat
    10| * opens on months-old messages instead of the latest turn. Root cause: the
    11| * message query had NO LIMIT and ordered ascending, so a conversation with
    12| * hundreds of turns forced the FlatList to lay out every message before
    13| * scroll-to-latest could anchor on the newest one — the scroll retry gave up
    14| * after ~1.5s and the viewport stayed at the top (months-old messages).
    15| *
    16| * Fix: bound the DB query to the newest 120 (descending) then reverse for
    17| * chronological display, and cap the merged result to the newest 160 so the
    18| * 400-row local mirror cannot re-introduce the slow-layout bug. These tests
    19| * prove the cap + merge keeps the newest messages in chronological order with
    20| * the latest turn as the last element — which is what scroll-to-latest and
    21| * initialScrollIndex target.
    22| */
